### Typing cursor

```css
@keyframes parpadeo {
  0%, 100% { border-right-color: transparent; }
  50%       { border-right-color: currentColor; }
}

.cursor-texto {
  border-right: 2px solid;
  animation: parpadeo 1s step-end infinite;
  padding-right: 2px;
}
```

