### Progress bar animada

```css
@keyframes llenar {
  from { width: 0; }
  to   { width: var(--progress, 100%); }
}

.barra-progreso {
  height: 8px;
  background: #E2E8F0;
  border-radius: 4px;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.barra-relleno {
  height: 100%;
  background: #3B82F6;
  --progress: 75%;
  animation: llenar 1.5s ease-out forwards;
}
```

